1900 GOSUB 6345:BM$="Susanna: David, this is Thomas Simon.":GOSUB 5100
1901 GOSUB 6355:BM$="Susanna: This is his wife, Lisa.":GOSUB 5100
1902 GOSUB 6365:BM$="Susanna: These are Burroughs, and...":GOSUB 5100
1903 GOSUB 6375:BM$="Susanna: Rivas.":GOSUB 5100
1904 GOSUB 6385:BM$="Susanna: And this is Greg. Each one of them has earned the title of dark\sorcerer.":GOSUB 5100:W2=0
1905 GOSUB 6310
1910 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: My name is David. I'm sorry you had to come all the way here just for\me.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1920 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: The dark sorcerers live to assist the Devil King. Don't worry\about it, David. Now, let the meeting begin.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1930 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Lisa: David, do you recognize the man in this picture? Have you seen him in\one of your dreams?":GOSUB 5100
1940 GOSUB 6180:BM$="David looked at the photo. He had never seen him before.":GOSUB 5100
1945 GOSUB 6355
1950 BM$="Lisa: This is the man who hired those detectives to follow you and your\colleagues during your tour of Europe.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1960 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Burroughs: Mr. Lands told us about how the King of the North cast a\terrible spell upon you. How did that happen? Where did he come from?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1970 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Well, in my nightmare, the castle was surrounded by armed peasants,\yelling at me to leave... and then, the King of the North appeared in my room.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1980 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Burroughs: He must have sent you that nightmare himself, in order to\appear before you and cast his spell. So the nightmare-warding ring was\ineffective against the King of the North...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1990 GOSUB 6380:BM$="Greg: What if next time he sends another nightmare, we also enter the\dream world and fight him?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2000 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Rivas: There's no guarantee we can defeat him with our magic. If we were\to lose, David's life would be forfeit.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2010 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Lisa: The King of the North sent a nightmare, entered it and then cast a\spell from within. None of us are capable of a similar feat. That is, unless\David were to become the Devil King...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2020 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Rivas: Our only choice is to find the King of the North and kill him with our\weapons. First, we must interrogate those detectives we captured, and\find out where their client is.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2030 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: They've been captured? Have they said the name of their\client?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2040 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Thomas: They wouldn't say, not even with a truth serum. They could be\descendants of the northern tribes. Our only choice is to borrow the\power of the Devil King, and cast a spell to find out.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2050 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I'm no sorcerer, I can't cast any spells. I've only ever had\nightmares and visions... Susanna, help me out here.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2060 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: It'll be fine. Greg, bring them here.":GOSUB 5100
2065 COMMON FO:BM$="Greg approached a wardrobe in the corner of the room and opened its\door.":GOSUB 5100
2066 GOSUB 9010:'
2067 W9=0:GOSUB 6150:BM$="He pulled out Clark and Vince, whose hands were tied behind their backs,\and brought them over.":GOSUB 5100
2070 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I had a feeling it would be you lot. Why won't you tell us the name\of your client? This is a matter of life and death for us.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2080 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: Is this how you repay us for saving your asses? A detective never\reveals the name of his client. I'm a professional!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2090 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I'm willing to kill you to find out. We could easily find out using the\powers of the Devil King, but that would leave you crippled for life.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2100 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: The Devil King, huh? We've been hearing that name a lot, but we still\don't know who that is. How about you introduce us? I'm telling you... We\know nothing about this King of the North, or the Devil King business.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2110 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Vince: Chief... I think she's serious. I don't want the Devil King to curse me... I\don't know anything about them, but you know the client. Just tell them.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2120 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: Shut the hell up. I'll never betray a client. It's a matter of pride. Go\ahead and kill me if you want. And don't bother with truth serums, I'm\trained to resist them.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2125 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: David, we need your help. Please, drink this. It's a sleeping\medicine. Once your blood has been quelled, I'll use a spell to draw out the\power of the Devil King, and get everything we need to know from them.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2130 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: You mean you can use magic...? Susanna, did you get close to me\because of the blood that flows in my veins...?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2140 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: No. I got close to you because I love you. I've had dreams about\you ever since I was born. I've loved you all my life. The only reason I've\been hiding the truth was to protect you from the King of the North.":GOSUB 5100
2150 BM$="Susanna: Besides, what if I told you about the Devil King during our first\meeting? You would have thought I was crazy and stayed away from me.\Please, you have to trust me... Drink this.":GOSUB 5100
2160 BM$="In truth, David was not particularly surprised by the revelation. It was\true that if not for Susanna, he would have been killed by the King of the\North, or possibly sent to a psychiatric ward.":GOSUB 5100
2170 BM$="However, he knew that using the spell to force the truth out of the\detectives would cripple them, or even kill them outright.":GOSUB 5100
2180 BM$="Susanna: They're part of the northern tribes. King Hroth said that the\sight of their blood would awaken the Devil King. You wouldn't have to fear\the King of the North any longer.":GOSUB 5100
2190 BM$="David believed Susanna's words, but the idea of killing the detectives\made him hesitate.":GOSUB 5100
2200 CM=2:CM$(1)="He decided to take Susanna's pills.":CM$(2)="He did not want to be involved in murder."
